    <description>&lt;p&gt;Breaking changes Passing backend=nothing is no longer supported. Omit the backend argument to use the default, and pass backend=() to skip the progress display altogether. Other changes ProgressLogging skips determinate updates smaller…&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    <content:encoded>&lt;h1&gt;MCMCProgress v0.2.0&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/MCMCProgress.jl/compare/v0.1.0...v0.2.0&quot;&gt;Diff since v0.1.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Breaking changes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Passing &lt;code&gt;backend=nothing&lt;/code&gt; is no longer supported.&lt;br&gt;
Omit the &lt;code&gt;backend&lt;/code&gt; argument to use the default, and pass &lt;code&gt;backend=()&lt;/code&gt; to skip the progress display altogether.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Other changes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ProgressLogging skips determinate updates smaller than half a percentage point to reduce log traffic.&lt;br&gt;
It still reports when a phase opens, closes, or transitions to or from 100%.&lt;/p&gt;
